# [DNSOP](../wg/dnsop.html)

## Summary

The DNSOP working group met at IETF 127. The session covered administration and draft status updates, a DNS Hackathon debrief, discussions on working group last call (WGLC) procedures, presentations on private top-level domain documentation, resolver caching optimizations, DNSSEC wildcard validation vulnerabilities, post-quantum cryptography (PQC) signature reduction schemes, zone digest extensions, and an extensive discussion regarding a proposed split of the working group into separate operational and protocol-maintenance working groups.

