### DNS Hackathon Summary
**Presenter:** Shumon Huque  
**Slides:** [DNS Hackathon Summary](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-dnsop-sessa-dns-hackathon-summary-00)

Shumon Huque summarized the project outcomes from the IETF 127 Hackathon DNS table:
* **ML-DSA-44 in Java:** David Blacka integrated MLDSA-44 PQC DNSSEC signature support into `jdnssec-tools` and established test zones verified by other participants.
